450
00:29:40.939 --> 00:29:41.746
Абигаил.
451
00:29:41.980 --> 00:29:44.161
<i>Де акуэрдо, Абигаил.</i>
452
00:29:44.395 --> 00:29:47.075
<i>¿Recuerdas esas buenas calificaciones
que sacaste en la Secundaria?</i>
453
00:29:47.309 --> 00:29:49.905
