Eso sería beber.
527
00:33:40.745 --> 00:33:41.968
Сайн байна уу?
528
00:33:42.202 --> 00:33:43.466
Pensaba que eras divertido,
Teacake.
529
00:33:43.700 --> 00:33:45.464
